WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.700
Conventional static evaluation pauses the world during inference.

00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:04.750
But the real world does not stop.

00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:07.650
We introduce RT-Safe: the embodied world keeps evolving while the agent thinks.

00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:13.500
The same initial scene and commanded move, with different world timing.

00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:14.950
Contact interrupts movement in the real-time illustration.
